   "id": "t-1129",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Skew in the wild: 1 B rows on 200 executors \u2014 199 tasks in 2 min, one straggler 38 min, then executor OOM.\nFix: salt the hot key \u2192 two-stage agg (16 \u00d7 25 M partials), or AQE skewJoin; cache only if reused \u22652\u00d7, then unpersist()",
   "originalText": "Skew in the wild: 1 B rows on 200 executors \u2014 199 tasks in 2 min, one straggler 38 min, then executor OOM.\nFix: salt the hot key \u2192 two-stage agg (16 \u00d7 25 M partials), or AQE skewJoin; cache only if reused \u22652\u00d7, then unpersist()",
